# The dashboard's js/lib holds source (URL-state, export, FEN and stats
# helpers), not a Python build artifact -- exempt it from the generic lib/
# rule above. Same for cm-chessboard's vendored lib/.
!src/packages/web/helpmate_web/static/js/lib/
!src/packages/web/helpmate_web/static/vendor/cm-chessboard/lib/
# hatchling's VCS-exclude matcher (src/packages/web/pyproject.toml's wheel
# build) applies these patterns relative to the subpackage root it is
# building from, not the repo root where this file lives -- unlike git,
# which always matches relative to a .gitignore's own location. Without a
# second, package-relative copy of the same two negations, the wheel build
# silently drops both lib/ directories even though `git ls-files` (and a
# checkout) look correct. Confirmed with the wheel zip-content check.
!helpmate_web/static/js/lib/
!helpmate_web/static/vendor/cm-chessboard/lib/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
